<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Creyf's prices capital increase.</title>
<headline>Belgian Creyf's prices capital increase.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian temporary employment group Creyf's NV published on Wednesday details of its planned capital increase, which is to pay for expansion into the Netherlands.</p>
<p>Creyf's said it would offer 265,298 new shares priced at 1,725 francs each. One new share will be offered to investors for every four presently held.</p>
<p>The offer runs from October 10 to 24.</p>
<p>The capital increase was announced earlier this month when Creyf's announced it had bought 90 percent of Dutch temporary work agency  Forrester BV.</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
